# =============================================================================
# MyVineChurch.Online – Comprehensive .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This file is designed to protect sensitive data, prevent committing large/generated
# files, and keep the repository clean while preserving all source code, templates,
# static assets (except uploads), and configuration that should be version-controlled.
#
# DO NOT commit anything listed here – especially encryption keys or user uploads.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python / Flask / General
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
.venv/
ENV/

# Environment variables & secrets
.env
.flaskenv
.local

# Sensitive encryption / config files (NEVER commit these)
config_key.bin
config_data.bin

# PyCharm / IDE files
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
.vscode/

# Database files (local SQLite – even if production uses MariaDB)
*.sqlite3
*.db
church_management.db

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project-specific generated / sensitive folders
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# User uploads (sermons, donation proofs, images, etc.)
uploads/
sermons_uploads/
static/uploads/
static/uploads/**/*

# Generated exports & reports (DOCX, PDFs, CSVs, etc.)
export/
exports/
export/**/*
exports/**/*

# Any potential large media or generated files
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.wav
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx

# Docker volumes or local containers (if you run MariaDB locally)
docker-volume/
mysql-data/

# =============================================================================
# What IS committed (for reference)
# =============================================================================
# - All source code (app/, main.py, etc.)
# - Templates (app/templates/ – including "possibly unused" ones; easy to delete later)
# - Static assets EXCEPT uploads (css, js, images that are part of the theme)
# - requirements.txt
# - docker-compose.yml (if you use it)
# - README.md, LICENSE, etc.

# If you later decide to remove legacy/unused files:
#   1. Delete them locally
#   2. git rm <file> (or git rm -r <folder>)
#   3. Commit the removal
# This .gitignore only prevents adding new unwanted files – it won't remove existing ones.

# Save this as .gitignore in the project root and commit it.